<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.delegation.grants ~ delegate ~ the root grants an agent a prefix

`lares intent delegate --agent <atom> --prefix <verb prefix> --policy <json>` signs a delegation under the face's root, bounded by `--as-of` and `--until` cites, with a fresh `--nonce` unless the line names one.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ delegate

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`delegate` params=`agent/<atom> prefix/wiki. policy/{} ~ grant an agent a prefix`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ agent · prefix · policy · as-of · until · nonce · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`agent` params=`takes/atom needs/required ~ the agent the grant names`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`prefix` params=`takes/prefix needs/required ~ the verb prefix granted`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`policy` params=`takes/json needs/required ~ the delegation policy as JSON`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`as-of` params=`takes/cite ~ the grant stands from this cite`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`until` params=`takes/cite ~ the grant stands until this cite`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nonce` params=`takes/hex ~ the grant's nonce`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose intent plane this reads or writes, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ root

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`root` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-root ~ a ward act: the face's root seed signs once and zero-fills; a seat without the route asks the root's hearth`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-malformed · face-not-held · delegation-shape · delegation-cite-malformed · root-absent · root-rotated

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ an unknown sub-verb, or no sub-verb named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`~ --face names a whole persona index from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-held` params=`~ this vessel holds no such face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`delegation-shape` params=`~ name agent, prefix and a JSON policy`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`delegation-cite-malformed` params=`~ a cite reads malformed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`root-absent` params=`~ this vessel holds no root`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`root-rotated` params=`~ the root rotated past this seed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

